# Cursor Developer & User Guide: Ecom SEO Trend Intelligence AI

## 1. Quick Start Commands

Run all commands from the repository root (`c:\Users\tarik\Desktop\Ecom Tools\ecom-seo`):

### Start the Application (Web Dashboard)
```bash
npm run dev -w @ecom-seo/web-dashboard
```
- Open in browser: `http://localhost:3000` (or `http://localhost:3001` if port 3000 is occupied).
- Features available immediately: Multi-platform Keyword Research, Seed Trend Charts, Device Share Distribution, CSV/JSON Exports, and Supabase Auth status.

### Run All Tests (97 Tests Passing)
```bash
npm test
```
- Runs test suites covering provider adapters, OAuth flows, secret redaction, rate limiting, and HTTP error resilience.

### Production Build & Type Check
```bash
npm run build -w @ecom-seo/web-dashboard
```

